    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/home-gadget/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Transform your website into a functional platform for presenting technology-focused content with the Home Gadget Theme, created to support the display of smart devices, innovative home gadgets, and everyday electronics. Suitable for ecommerce setups, tech product shops, gadget affiliate blogs, review-based niche sites, and dropshipping gadget stores, the theme provides a responsive layout with clean design and SEO-friendly structure. It includes customizable sections that allow organized presentation of smart home product categories such as kitchen tools, lighting options, entertainment systems, security equipment, and other utility-focused gadgets. Features like product sliders, image galleries, video support, and comparison sections help structure content clearly for users exploring different products. Integration with WooCommerce enables product listing and transaction management, while compatibility with plugins like Contact Form 7, Yoast SEO, and Mailchimp supports communication, optimization, and audience engagement. The layout is designed to adapt across devices, offering consistent navigation on mobile, tablet, and desktop screens for users browsing tech-related content or product listings."
    },
